{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":477543,"name":"Johannes","username":"Johannes_Isabell","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/j/71c47a/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-08-29T10:44:31.235Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-477543-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-477543-feature-request-for-productservice-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFeature request for product/service\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCloud Agent (GitHub, Slack, Linear,…)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-477543-describe-the-request-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-477543-describe-the-request-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the request\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo co-founders, one business, one Grok Bot staff.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe both need to message the same bots — Sales, Ops, Chief of Staff — in our own chats, without sharing one login.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eToday that is not possible. Each seat gets its own computer and its own roster. Sharing a bot only creates a copy. Copies do not share memory, files, logins, or conversation history, so they drift immediately.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat we want:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOne company roster both of us can talk to\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSeparate private chats per person\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShared working context (memory / files / tool sessions), not just a template\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTemplate sharing and “shared rooms” (same thread, two people) are useful but not this\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am seeing more and more requests for this on X too.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-477543-operating-system-if-it-applies-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-477543-operating-system-if-it-applies-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System (if it applies)\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":12,"updated_at":"2026-08-29T10:44:38.483Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":546,"reads":32,"readers_count":31,"score":2886.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":169904,"topic_slug":"shared-grok-bot-team-across-teammates-same-roster-separate-chats","display_username":"Johannes","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":10}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135115,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shared-grok-bot-team-across-teammates-same-roster-separate-chats/169904/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":10}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":10,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":true},{"id":478084,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-30T11:28:33.979Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/johannes_isabell\"\u003e@Johannes_Isabell\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the suggestion!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou are right that sharing a bot today creates a copy. \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/bot/status/2093376523919323618?s=20\"\u003eBot templates\u003c/a\u003e shipped recently as a first step, but they do not carry over live memory or conversation history.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe good news is that deeper team collaboration, where teammates can work with the same bots instead of copies, is something the team is actively working on! Keep an eye on upcoming releases.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":12,"updated_at":"2026-08-30T11:28:33.979Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":16,"reads":29,"readers_count":28,"score":225.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":169904,"topic_slug":"shared-grok-bot-team-across-teammates-same-roster-separate-chats","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2093376523919323618?s=20","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Grok Bot on X: \"You can now share templates of your Bots with others.\" / X","clicks":14}],"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":9}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/shared-grok-bot-team-across-teammates-same-roster-separate-chats/169904/5","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":9}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":9,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":478145,"name":"Johannes","username":"Johannes_Isabell","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/j/71c47a/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-08-30T12:04:08.080Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ethat’s great! Please make sure that the transition will be easy. E.g. I invite my cofounder with her own subscr